# Digital Daftar Network — UI Walkthrough

## Screen Map (All 30 Screens)

```mermaid
graph TD
    A[Splash Screen] --> B[Welcome Screen]
    B --> C[Login Screen]
    B --> D[Register as Donor]
    B --> E[Register Madarsa/Mosque]
    C --> F{Role}
    D --> F
    E --> G[Pending Approval Screen]
    F -- donor --> H[Donor Dashboard]
    F -- org_admin --> I[Admin Dashboard]
    F -- collector --> J[Collector Dashboard]
    F -- super_admin --> K[Super Admin Dashboard]
    H --> L[Org Directory / All Orgs]
    H --> M[Donate Flow - 4 Steps]
    H --> N[Donation History]
    H --> O[Settings]
    L --> P[Org Profile Screen]
    P --> M
    I --> Q[Reports Screen - Category Breakdown]
    I --> R[Collector Management]
    J --> S[New Collection]
    J --> T[Daily Report]
    K --> U[Approval Queue]
```

