## Route Map

| Route | Screen |
|-------|--------|
| `/splash` | SplashScreen |
| `/welcome` | WelcomeScreen |
| `/login` | LoginScreen |
| `/register?role=donor` | RegistrationScreen (Donor) |
| `/register?role=org_admin` | RegistrationScreen (Org Admin) |
| `/pending` | PendingApprovalScreen |
| `/donor` | DonorDashboardScreen |
| `/orgs` | OrgDirectoryScreen |
| `/donate` | DonationFlowScreen (4-step) |
| `/donor/history` | DonationHistoryScreen |
| `/admin/:orgId` | AdminDashboard |
| `/admin/:orgId/reports` | ReportsScreen |
| `/admin/:orgId/collectors` | CollectorManagement |
| `/collector/:orgId` | CollectorDashboard |
| `/collector/intake/:orgId` | CollectorIntakeScreen |
| `/collector/report/:orgId` | DailyReportScreen |
| `/super-admin` | SuperAdminDashboard |
| `/settings` | SettingsScreen |

## Key UI Features

### Donation Category Logic
- **Madarsa**: Zakat ✅ · Sadaqah ✅ · Lillah ✅ · Imdad ✅ · General ✅  
- **Mosque**: Zakat ❌ · Sadaqah ❌ · Lillah ✅ · Imdad ✅ · General ✅

### Theme
- Primary: `#006837` (Emerald Green)
- Accent: `#D4AF37` (Islamic Gold)
- Gradient: `#004D2E` → `#006837`
